  "summary": "<p>Over the past month, President Donald J. Trump and Vice President JD Vance maintained an unmatched pace of travel across the country, meeting with Americans face-to-face to highlight the Administration’s Promises Made, Promises Kept record. Recent coverage underscored the scale of the travel: The Daily Wire: Trump Touts Drug Discounts, Patient Payments In Final Midterm Push“As [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/icymi-relentless-travel-schedule-puts-trump-administrations-results-front-and-center/\">ICYMI: Relentless Travel Schedule Puts Trump Administration’s Results Front and Center</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
