t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Over the past month, President Donald J. Trump and Vice President JD Vance maintained an unmatched pace of <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/president-trump-completes-historic-travel-blitz-30-events-20-states-32-days/\">travel</a> across the country, meeting with Americans face-to-face to highlight the Administration’s <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/president-trumps-second-term-promises-made-promises-kept-results-delivered/\">Promises Made, Promises Kept</a> record.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Recent coverage underscored the scale of the travel:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.dailywire.com/news/trump-touts-drug-discounts-patient-payments-in-final-midterm-push\"><strong>The Daily Wire</strong></a><strong>: Trump Touts Drug Discounts, Patient Payments In Final Midterm Push</strong><br><em>“As President Donald Trump made prescription drug discounts and direct payments to patients part of his closing pitch to voters, highlighting the administration’s health care initiatives… The president participated in 29 campaign rallies since the convention, as well as multiple tele-rallies on Monday evening, and he often used the rallies as an opportunity to highlight major health care announcements. Meanwhile, his administration was rolling out a series of healthcare initiatives, such as the $500 Obamacare refund checks, $90 Medicare checks for seniors, $275 million devoted to recruiting nurses for nursing homes, and historic investments in rural healthcare.”</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.dailysignal.com/2026/11/03/trumps-midterm-travel-blitz-surpasses-predecessors/\"><strong>The Daily Signal</strong></a><strong>: Trump’s Midterm Travel Runs Circles Around Obama, Biden</strong><br><em>“President Donald Trump has held more than 30 events from Oct. 1 to Election Day as part of his ‘midterm blitz,’ far exceeding the travel of his Democrat predecessors. Trump has held 30 events in 20 states in 32 days. From Oct. 1 to Nov. 1, he visited Alabama, Alaska, Arizona, Florida (twice), Georgia (twice), Iowa (twice), Kansas (twice), Kentucky, Maryland, Michigan, Mississippi, Montana, Nebraska, New York, North Carolina, Ohio (three times), Oklahoma, South Carolina (twice), Tennessee, and Texas (four times).”</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.dailywire.com/news/exclusive-inside-the-trump-cabinets-all-out-midterm-campaign-offensive\"><strong>The Daily Wire</strong></a><strong>: Inside The Trump Cabinet’s All-Out Midterm Campaign Offensive</strong><br><em>“President Donald Trump’s Cabinet completed almost 200 travel stops during the month of October as they worked to highlight the wins of the president’s second term to the American people. Trump’s Cabinet members traveled every day in October, making 199 stops across 38 states and 141 congressional districts…”</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://washingtonreporter.news/exclusive-trump-closes-out-midterms-with-almost-200-historic-public-facing-efforts-to-advance-his-america-first-agenda/\"><strong>Washington Reporter</strong></a><strong>: Trump closes out midterms with almost 200 “historic public-facing efforts” to advance his America First agenda</strong><br><em>“President Donald Trump closed out the 2026 midterm elections on a historic pace, in stark contrast with how President Joe Biden spent the waning days of the 2022 midterms. In the three months running up to the election, Trump did almost 200 press-facing events, spanning rallies, gaggles, and standard remarks… The 170 press-facing events that Trump has done since August 1 total over 85 hours, and include 79 remarks, 62 gaggles, and 29 sprays. At 83 of his events, Trump has answered questions from the press.”</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/trump-takes-midterm-campaign-blitz-historic-stage-grand-finale-before-election-day\"><strong>Fox News</strong></a><strong>: Trump takes midterm campaign blitz to historic stage for grand finale before Election Day</strong><br><em>“The president has made 30 in-person political appearances since August, including more than 27 rallies in October&#8230;”</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.breitbart.com/politics/2026/11/02/trump-vance-50-travel-stops-firstever-rnc-convention/\"><strong>Breitbart</strong></a><strong>: Men on a Mission: Trump, Vance Made 50 Travel Stops Since First-Ever Midterm RNC Convention</strong><br><em>“President Donald Trump and Vice President JD Vance have made a combined 50 stops around the country for speeches, announcements, and rallies…Since the Republican midterm convention on September 9 and 10 in Dallas, Texas, Trump has traveled around the country, with trips spanning from Alaska to Maryland, for 31 speeches and announcements. He has made multiple stops in key states with major Senate and congressional races, including North Carolina, Texas, Iowa, Georgia, and Ohio.”</em></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/icymi-relentless-travel-schedule-puts-trump-administrations-results-front-and-center/\">ICYMI: Relentless Travel Schedule Puts Trump Administration’s Results Front and Center</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
